{"dossier":"D12","entry_points":[{"sids":["kernel/vmcore_info.c::crash_save_vmcoreinfo_init"],"text":"Boot crash init reserves zeroed metadata and note areas, records release, sizes, offsets and tags, calls arch hook, then publishes note."},{"sids":["kernel/workqueue.c::queue_delayed_work_on","kernel/workqueue.c::mod_delayed_work_on","kernel/workqueue.c::delayed_work_timer_fn","kernel/workqueue.c::rcu_work_rcufn"],"text":"Delayed queue skips if pending or disabled; modify re-arms; timer and RCU callbacks queue inner work, RCU as unbound."},{"sids":["kernel/workqueue.c::flush_delayed_work","kernel/workqueue.c::cancel_work","kernel/workqueue.c::schedule_on_each_cpu","kernel/workqueue.c::execute_in_process_context"],"text":"Delayed flush deletes timer then flushes; cancel selects variants via bits; per-CPU runner and process-context helper defer as needed."},{"sids":["kernel/workqueue.c::__init_work","kernel/workqueue.c::destroy_delayed_work_on_stack"],"text":"Work init registers debug tracking distinguishing on-stack and heap; delayed on-stack teardown stops timer then releases tracking."}],"exports":[{"sids":["kernel/vhost_task.c::vhost_task_create","kernel/vhost_task.c::vhost_task_start","kernel/vhost_task.c::vhost_task_wake","kernel/vhost_task.c::vhost_task_stop"],"text":"Vhost worker offers create with work and kill callbacks and owner data, separate start, explicit wake, and stop freeing descriptor after exit."},{"sids":["kernel/watch_queue.c::__post_watch_notification","kernel/watch_queue.c::watch_queue_set_size","kernel/watch_queue.c::watch_queue_set_filter"],"text":"Watch broadcast filters per queue and posts; sizing is one-time with accounting checks; filter install swaps compact filter or clears."},{"sids":["kernel/watch_queue.c::add_watch_to_object","kernel/watch_queue.c::remove_watch_from_object"],"text":"At most one binding per queue and identifier with per-user limits; removal targets one watch or all with notification and optional release."},{"sids":["k